              id="736f433e-4a0c-442d-ae21-2f8f01cb64b4" name="Grade Road Surface"
              description="Grader Operator activity - perform grading passes to achieve and maintain a level road surface. Realizes the &amp;#x27;Grade Road Surface&amp;#x27; operational capability."/>
